      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable how the idea of ultimate meaninglessness can feel overwhelming and lead to despair. Many people struggle with these existential questions, and those thoughts can feel incredibly powerful and absolute. If you are feeling this intensely, please remember that even in the face of big questions, there is support available right now to help you through the pain. You can connect with people who want to listen by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada.",
      "source": "target",
